[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4522251545","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119662#issuecomment-4522251545","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119662","id":4522251545,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDYwVGQ","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-22T19:48:38Z","updated_at":"2026-05-22T19:48:38Z","body":"I can't reproduce the issue with the mentioned steps. Please, provide a proper MRP with the files instead of the text.\n\n> MRP Requiring\n>\n> A small Godot project which reproduces the issue, with no unnecessary files included. Be sure to not include the .godot folder in the archive (but keep project.godot).\n> Having an MRP is very important for contributors to be able to reproduce the bug in the same way that you are experiencing it. When testing a potential fix for the issue, contributors will use the MRP to validate that the fix is working as intended.\n> Drag and drop a ZIP archive to upload it (max 10 MB). Do not select another field until the project is done uploading.\n> Note for C# users: If your issue is not C#-specific, please upload a minimal reproduction project written in GDScript. This will make it easier for contributors to reproduce the issue locally as not everyone has a .NET setup available.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4522251545/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4544771716","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119662#issuecomment-4544771716","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119662","id":4544771716,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDuO2hA","user":{"login":"Oblepikha","id":77234360,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MjM0MzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77234360?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha","html_url":"https://github.com/Oblepikha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oblepikha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-26T14:00:47Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T10:48:24Z","body":"Godot v4.7.beta3 - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) Iris(R) Xe Graphics (Intel Corporation; 32.0.101.7085) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-1135G7 @ 2.40GHz (8 threads) - 15.80 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\nI have the same issue. The editor crashes without any errors when adding Area3D > CollisionShape3D > SphereShape3D.\n\nIt does not crash if the nodes are added while the main screen is set to the Script editor instead of the 3D viewport. However, after switching back to the 3D view and selecting the collision shape, the editor crashes.\n\n~UPDATE: I cannot reproduce this issue in a new project, only in an existing one~\n\nUPDATE: The issue only occurs when using Vulkan. Everything works fine with D3D","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4544771716/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4566209031","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119662#issuecomment-4566209031","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119662","id":4566209031,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABECrSBw","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"http